		{"id":"cbec860416ba5c34","type":"text","text":"# FilePNG\n\n## Structures\nPixel \n```C\ntypedef struct {\n\tint r;\n\tint g;\n\tint b;\n\tint a;\t\n} pix;\n```\nImage \n```C\ntypedef struct {\n\tint width, height, numChannel;\n\tpix ** matrix;\n} _img, *Image;\n```\n\n## Function needed\nModify a pixel in a Image\nBrush from GPT\nSave to a PNG file \n\n","x":-460,"y":-100,"width":460,"height":680,"color":"3"},
