		{"id":"e98f7d2399bf59f4","type":"text","text":"# Simple Pendulum\n\n## Structures\nPendulum\n```C\ntypedef struct {\n\tfloat x1,y1; // fixe\n\tfloat x2, y2; // tip\n\tfloat vx2,vy2; // speed tip\n\tfloat mass;\n\tpix color;\n} *SimplePen;\n```\nConstante \nGravity g\n## Function needed\ncreate a pendulum\nupdate pendulum (dt)\ndraw pendulum\n\n## Todo\nWorkout the math of the forces","x":600,"y":-100,"width":460,"height":620,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d25191e173d59405","type":"file","file":"Excalidraw/Simple pendulum math.md","x":630,"y":580,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"846fcdb373a18f89","type":"text","text":"## Bilan des forces\n- $\\overrightarrow P = m\\overrightarrow g$\n- $\\overrightarrow T$ (tension du fil)\n- pas de frottement air\n\n## PFD\n$\\sum \\overrightarrow F = m\\overrightarrow a \\propto \\overrightarrow N$\nDonc on fait un projetée de $\\overrightarrow P$ sur le vecteur normale $\\overrightarrow N$ ce qui donne $m\\overrightarrow a = L m g cos(\\theta)$\nSoit $\\overrightarrow a = L g cos(\\theta) \\approx L g \\theta$ \n\n\n\n","x":630,"y":1080,"width":490,"height":320},
